25ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.262ex\" height=\"1.025ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 1000 453\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"221E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-221E\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>), its potential energy is</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -1.601ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22.744ex\" height=\"3.827ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -983.7 10052.6 1691.5\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D448\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D448\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(716,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D456\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D456\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1287.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"munder\" transform=\"translate(2343.5,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"OP\" transform=\"translate(172.1,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"6C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6C\"></use><use data-c=\"69\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-69\" transform=\"translate(278,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"6D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6D\" transform=\"translate(556,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(0,-600) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D45F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45F\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(451,0)\"><use data-c=\"2192\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-219